---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | DigiiState OS">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-24">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 p-16 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none">
				<p class="text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-12">Last Updated: August 20, 2026</p>
				
				<h3>1. Lead Data & Triage</h3>
				<p>We collect lead information (names, phone numbers, inquiry details) specifically to route them to our business partners. This data is processed through our Make.com triage layer and stored securely in Supabase. We do not sell this data to third-party marketing firms.</p>

				<h3>2. Communication Recording</h3>
				<p>Calls and SMS generated by our assets are recorded via the Twilio Voice Engine for quality assurance and revenue attribution. These recordings are accessible to both DigiiState and the active territory partner for the duration of the lease.</p>

				<h3>3. Institutional Security</h3>
				<p>Administrative access to DigiiState OS is governed by our "Zero Trust" model. All database interactions are protected by Row Level Security (RLS) ensuring that partners can only access data explicitly linked to their organization ID.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
